OL,3,AOfsted faces fresh calls to halt graded
OL,4,Aschool inspections in England
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second head teachers' union has
OL,7,Fcalled for a halt to graded Ofsted
OL,8,Finspections in England, saying it is
OL,9,F"increasingly concerned about the
OL,10,Fwelfare and morale" of its members.
OL,12,FThe Association of School and College
OL,13,FLeaders (ASCL) also raised the prospect
OL,14,Fof potential strike action, saying a
OL,15,Fnew grading system had become an
OL,16,F"overbearing mess".
OL,18,FOn Friday, Ofsted's chief inspector Sir
OL,19,FMartyn Oliver said an independent
OL,20,Fsurvey of education providers showed it
OL,21,Fwas "on the right track" with
OL,22,Finspections.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
